# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository holds CODE. Observations and fit products stay out of it.
#
# Native observations, calibration inputs and saved results live outside Git.
# Source configurations and workflow code are versioned; run reports record
# the exact input/code checksums and settings used for each scientific result.
# Existing notebooks live under notebooks/legacy and notebooks/validation.
# The multi-source interface is planned; `dingo.run` is historical.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Staged cutouts (R/C grism + direct image per source). Configs are KEPT.
data/**/*.fits

# psf/webbPSF_F444W.fits IS tracked, deliberately, despite being a FITS file.
# It is a calibration input rather than an observation or a fit product, it is
# 743 KB, and without it a fresh clone cannot run the morphology fit at all.
# It previously lived in an old run's output directory, so archiving that run
# silently broke diagnostics/measure_inclination.py.

# Chains, checkpoints, derived posteriors, plots, run logs.
results/
logs/

# Superseded notebooks and a duplicate copy of the ID15665 cutouts.
Archive_6/

# Scratch output from the figure and map scripts.
maps/
*.log

# Historical notebooks retain their original bytes, including large outputs.
# Keep the three formerly tracked examples available for version control;
# preserve the remaining experiments locally without adding their outputs.
# The most recent notebooks under legacy/ and validation/ remain eligible for
# version control, including their preserved review outputs.
notebooks/archive/*.ipynb
# !notebooks/archive/fit-kinematics-mcmc.ipynb
# !notebooks/archive/kinematics.ipynb
# !notebooks/archive/poster-plots.ipynb
run_dingo_sample.ipynb
1-fit-kinematics.ipynb
drizzle_utils.py


# Notebooks, inputs and backups stay local
*.ipynb
data/
psf/
docs/notebook_backups/
*.npz
*.fits
